### Negative-findings notes

- Exact-phrase web search for `"mai-experimental-test"` (2026-10-10) returned no
  model card, benchmark table, changelog, or vendor page using this ID.
- The OpenCode Zen docs endpoints/pricing tables (fetched 2026-10-10) do not
  include `mai-experimental-test`; the live `/zen/v1/models` roster does not
  list it either.
- Microsoft AI (MAI) publishes separate shipping models (e.g. MAI-Image-2.6);
  no public MAI text-model announcement maps to this ID. Treating the slug as
  an anonymous Zen test route is the best-supported reading, but it remains
